>> title: Seared Halloumi, Air Fryer
>> category: Fried & Crispy
>> tags: halloumi, cheese, air fryer, basket, vegetarian, hot honey
>> counters: The Air Fryer & the Pot
>> dish: seared-halloumi
>> kit: Air Fryer
>> aka: air fryer halloumi, basket halloumi, air fried halloumi, halloumi slabs in the air fryer
>> servings: 4
>> time: 15 min
>> slack: unforgiving — halloumi is only itself hot; ten minutes on a cold plate and it sets to squeaking rubber that reheating will not undo
>> washing-up: the basket
>> capacity: 4 — one 5.7 L air fryer basket, roast, air fry
>> keeps: not at all — there is no version of this that survives the plate it was carried to

>> step: Written for a preheated 5.7 L basket. From cold, add three minutes. A 3.5 L basket is two batches, not more minutes.
No oil at all, and the honey goes on at the table. One thing in the sink.

>> step: rinse the brine off, dry hard, lay in the basket
Rinse @halloumi{9%oz}(250 g) under cold water, cut into 1/2-in slabs, press dry between towels and lay them in a preheated #air fryer basket{}.

>> step: roast in the basket 200°C (400°F), 8–10 min, one layer not touching
Roast @&(~1)halloumi slabs{} at 200°C (400°F) for ~air fry{9%min}, one layer with a gap between each slab.

>> step: turn at five minutes — blistered gold, and it stops squeaking
Turn @&(~1)halloumi{} once.

>> step: spoon the honey over at the table
Spoon @honey{2%Tbs} over @&(~1)hot halloumi{} with @red chile flakes{1/2%tsp}, @lemon{1%wedge}, @dried oregano{1/4%tsp}.
